      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "The army paraded past on floats, towed by a number of Glitch workers and a Floran who'd decided to join in unannounced. Dreadwing sat atop his iron throne, brought outside into the city, and applauded each and every unit. 'They stand very still,' he remarked, to which his aides replied 'yes, they are very disciplined.'"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "部隊は山車に乗ってパレードをし、多くのグリッチ労働者と未発表で参加することに決めたフローランに牽引されました。 ドレッドウィングは鉄の玉座の上に座り、市外に持ち出され、各部隊を拍手した。 「彼らはじっとしている」と彼は言い、側近は「はい、とても規律がある」と答えた。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "As the last float made its way down the street, the entire crowd gasped as one of the soldiers leaped from the stand, and charged towards Dreadwing. Most surprised of all were the blacksmiths, who knew full well that their 'soldiers' were little more than decorative suits of armour. Dreadwing, however, thought it was all part of the show."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "最後の山車が通りを進むと、兵士の一人がスタンドから飛び降りてドレッドウィングに向かって突進したので、群衆全体が突進した。 もっとも驚いたのは鍛冶屋たちで、「兵士」は装甲の装飾的なスーツに過ぎないことをよく知っていた。 しかし、ドレッドウィングは、それがすべてショーの一部だと思った。"
    }
